abstract: >-
  Research code accompanying Simulation-Based Alignment Research for Embodied
  Agents: A Colosseum Testbed for Autonomous UAVs in Civilian Defence. Includes
  the frozen controller, runtime safeguards, independent evaluation, protocols,
  the complete computed dataset for 792 selected episodes, one authentic recorded
  episode, and tools for checking the deposited evidence. The source-code license
  does not grant rights to third-party simulator assets or a blanket data license.
keywords:
  - embodied agents
  - AI alignment
  - simulation
  - runtime assurance
  - research reproducibility
